{"benchmark": "livebench_selected", "task_id": "paraphrase:f4cbfc58a683894a66b028420969bb75a35fe4acda1bd3dce0024062c11b2041", "sample_idx": 34, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "\"To access the print version of the article, a link is provided. The rules for solving the Sudoku puzzle are similar to the standard rules, with a notable exception. This exception involves the cells that are enclosed within grey lines, which must add up to the numbers displayed in the corner. The standard Sudoku rule of not repeating numbers within a specific shape also applies, with the shapes being formed by the grey lines in this case.\"\n\n\n \nAddition to the standard Sudoku rules includes the requirement for the numbers in the cells within grey lines to sum up to the figures in the corner. This adds a new layer of complexity to the puzzle, as solvers must balance the standard Sudoku rules with this new constraint. The shapes formed by the grey lines are the key to solving the puzzle, as each shape must contain unique numbers that add up to the correct total.\n\n\n \nThe completed puzzle will be available in next week's Observer Digital Edition. This provides a solution for those who are struggling to solve the puzzle or who want to check their answers. The Observer Digital Edition is a valuable resource for puzzle enthusiasts, offering a range of challenges and games to enjoy. By purchasing the digital edition, readers can access the completed puzzle and other exclusive content.\n\n\n \nThe rules of the Sudoku puzzle are designed to be challenging but solvable. The use of grey lines to enclose cells and create unique shapes adds a new level of complexity to the puzzle. However, with careful attention to the rules and a logical approach, solvers can work through the puzzle and find the solution. The sense of accomplishment that comes from solving the puzzle is rewarding and enjoyable.\n\n\n \nThe Sudoku puzzle is a fun and challenging way to exercise the brain and improve problem-solving skills. The unique rules and constraints of the puzzle require solvers to think creatively and logically, making it a great activity for those who enjoy puzzles and games. By working through the puzzle and using the rules provided, solvers can develop their critical thinking skills and have fun at the same time. \"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.4018803536891937}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305700585246086}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0232519693672657}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.008725020103156567}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -7.486063259420916e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0031777145341038704}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011118361726403236}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -0.2270030528306961}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.002512990264222026}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.024781323969364166}, {"token": " link", "logprob": -0.008299149572849274}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.0067192567512393}, {"token": " provided", "logprob": -0.00012361239350866526}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.31154054403305054}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.0039595551788806915}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.11019902676343918}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.02659463882446289}, {"token": " solving", "logprob": -0.5781631469726562}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.03187396004796028}, {"token": " Sudoku", "logprob": -0.12209165841341019}, {"token": " puzzle", "logprob": -4.970903682988137e-05}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -7.319182623177767e-05}, {"token": " similar", "logprob": -1.3415961265563965}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -2.312633478140924e-05}, {"token": " standard", "logprob": -0.05010475590825081}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.004639219027012587}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.9073304429184645e-05}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.0019315887475386262}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.07293851673603058}, {"token": " notable", "logprob"